msgstr "{actor} je izbrisao/izbrisala nit {channel}"

#. Activity log summary when a voice channel was deleted. {actor} is the member who made the change, shown as a clickable user chip, or the word System. {channel} is the deleted channel, shown as a channel chip with the name it had.
#: src/features/guild/utils/guild_tabs/audit_log/AuditLogChannelMessages.ts
msgid "{actor} deleted the voice channel {channel}"
msgstr "{actor} je izbrisao glasovni kanal {channel}"

#. Activity log summary for a deleted webhook when its channel was not recorded. {actor} is the member who deleted the webhook, shown as a clickable user chip, or the word System. {name} is the name the webhook had, shown in bold by the app. Do not add ** or <b> around it.
#: src/features/guild/utils/guild_tabs/audit_log/AuditLogInviteWebhookMessages.ts
msgid "{actor} deleted the webhook {name}"
msgstr "{actor} je izbrisao webhook {name}"

